#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:249
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, topLevel)
#: rc.cpp:544
msgid "Check if the DTEP can act as a top level DTEP."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn sik dat DTBP op de böverste Evene bruken lett."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:252
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, topLevel)
#: rc.cpp:547
msgid ""
"Check if the DTEP can act as a top level DTEP. This means that the document "
"can be of this type. Some pseudo DTEPs cannot act as a top level DTEP, like "
"<i>PHP</i> as they are always included as part of another DTEP, while some "
"others can be included and act as standalone as well, like the case of "
"<i>CSS</i>."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn sik dat Dokmenttyp-Bewrkpaket (DTBP) op de böverste Evene "
"bruken lett. Dat bedüüdt, dat Dokment kann vun dissen Typ wesen. En poor "
"Pseudo-DTBPs laat sik nich op de böverste Evene bruken, so as <i>PHP</i>. Se "
"warrt jümmers as Deel vun en anner DTBP inslaten. En poor anner laat sik man "
"ok alleen bruken, so as <i>CSS</i>."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:255
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, topLevel)
#: rc.cpp:550
msgid "Top level"
msgstr "Böverst Evene"

