#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1267
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, structEndEdit)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/quantacore/dialogs/dtepeditdlgs.ui:1277
