#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (ProjectTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:29
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (TemplatesTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:51
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:13
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (ProjectTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:29
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (TemplatesTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:51
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#: rc.cpp:3093 rc.cpp:3105 rc.cpp:3123
msgid ""
"If this option is true the tree will display tooltips with additional "
"information about the files and folders of the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit \"Wohr\" is, warrt Kortinfos mit mehr Informatschonen över de "
"Dateien un Ornern vun't Dateisysteem wiest."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:18
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (ProjectTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:34
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (TemplatesTreeView)
