#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (ProjectTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:34
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (TemplatesTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:62
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#: rc.cpp:3096 rc.cpp:3108 rc.cpp:3132
msgid "Remember the status of the tree."
msgstr "Den Boom sien Status wohren"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:19
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (ProjectTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:35
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (TemplatesTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:63
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:19
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (ProjectTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:35
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (TemplatesTreeView)
#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:63
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#: rc.cpp:3099 rc.cpp:3111 rc.cpp:3135
msgid ""
"If this option is true the tree will save the status and try to open all "
"folders again and resize the columns."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit \"Wohr\" is, wohrt de Boom sien Status, he maakt Ornern wedder op "
"ok de Striep warrt wedder herstellt."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:44
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#: rc.cpp:3114
msgid "Always show the Root and Home items."
msgstr "Jümmers Tohuus- un Wörtelornerindrääg wiesen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:45
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#: rc.cpp:3117
msgid ""
"If this option is true the tree will show two entries for Root and the Home "
"folder which can not be removed."
msgstr ""
"Is dit \"Wohr\", wiest de Boom Indrääg för de Wörtel un den Tohuusorner, de "
"sik nich wegmaken laat."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:56
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#: rc.cpp:3126
msgid "Show hidden files and folder in the tree."
msgstr "Versteken Dateien un Ornern binnen den Boom wiesen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:57
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (FilesTreeView)
#: rc.cpp:3129
msgid ""
"If this option is true the tree will display entries for hidden files and "
"folders of the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit \"Wohr\" is, warrt versteken Dateien un Ornern binnen den "
"Dateisysteemboom wiest."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:73
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (StructureTree)
#: rc.cpp:3138
msgid "Show whitespace areas and empty groups in the trees"
msgstr "Freetekenrebeden un leddig Koppeln binnen Bööm wiesen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:74
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (StructureTree)
#: rc.cpp:3141
msgid ""
"If this option is true the tree will display entries for areas with "
"whitespaces in between tags. All defined groups of the document will also be "
"shown even if no element was found in the document."
msgstr ""
"Is disse Optschoon \"Wohr\", wiest de Boom Indrääg för Freeruum twischen "
"Betekers. Dat Dokment sien fastleggt Koppeln warrt ok all wiest, ok wenn se "
"keen Elementen bargt."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:79
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (StructureTree)
#: rc.cpp:3144
msgid "Show closing tags in the tree"
msgstr "Ennbetekers binnen den Boom wiesen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:80
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (StructureTree)
#: rc.cpp:3147
msgid "If this option is true the tree will display entries for closing tags."
msgstr "Is disse Optschoon \"Wohr\", wiest de Boom Indrääg för Ennbetekers."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:85
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (StructureTree)
#: rc.cpp:3150
msgid "Adjust the Structure Tree to the cursor position"
msgstr "Struktuurboom na de Blinkersteed topassen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:86
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (StructureTree)
#: rc.cpp:3153
msgid ""
"If this option is true the tree will scroll to the item that belongs to the "
"current cursor position in the document."
msgstr ""
"Is disse Optschoon \"Wohr\", rullt de Boom na dat Element, binnen dat de "
"Blinker opstunns binnen dat Dokment steiht."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:94
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3156
msgid "Enable auto-completion"
msgstr "Autom. Kompletteren bruken"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:95
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3159
msgid ""
"If true, the completion hints are shown automatically as the user types. If "
"false, the completion hints can still be invoked manually."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de mööglichen Kompletteren automaatsch wiest, wen de "
"Bruker wat ingifft. Wenn utmaakt, laat sik de Kompletteren jümmers noch vun "
"Hand opropen."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:100
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3162
msgid "Auto-close non single and non optional tags"
msgstr "Normaal Betekers automaatsch afsluten"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:101
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3165
msgid ""
"If true, when the closing char for a non single and non optional tag is "
"entered, the corresponding closing tag is automatically inserted."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de Ennbeteker automaatsch inföögt, wenn dat Tomaakteken "
"för en normaal Beteker ingeven warrt."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:107
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3171
msgid ""
"If true, when the closing char for a tag is entered, and the closing tag for "
"this tag is optional, the corresponding closing tag is automatically "
"inserted."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt de tohören Ennbeteker automaatsch inföögt, wenn dat "
"Tomaakteken för en Beteker ingeven warrt un de Ennbeteker köörfree is."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:112
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3174
msgid "Update opening/closing tags automatically"
msgstr "Start- un Ennbetekers automaatsch opfrischen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:113
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3177
msgid ""
"When this option is true the closing pair of a tag is automatically updated "
"when the opening tag is changed and vice-versa."
msgstr ""
"Wenn disse Optschoon \"Wohr\" is, warrt de tohören Ennbeteker automaatsch "
"opfrischt, wenn Een den Startbeteker ännert, un annersrüm."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:119
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Autocompletion)
#: rc.cpp:3183
msgid ""
"If activated, the accented characters will be automatically replaced on "
"typing with their corresponding XML enitities."
msgstr ""
"Wenn anmaakt, warrt för Bookstaven mit Akzenten automaatsch de tohören XML-"
"Entiteten inwesselt."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:126
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3186
msgid "Default DTD"
msgstr "Standard-DTD"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:127
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3189
msgid ""
"The DTD used for files without invalid or unknown !DOCTYPE line as well for "
"the newly created files. If there is a different project default DTD "
"specified, that one is used instead of this setting."
msgstr ""
"De DTD för Dateien, de en leeg oder nich begäng !DOCTYPE-Reeg hebbt, un för "
"nieg opstellt Dateien. Is för't hele Projekt en anner Standard-DTD "
"fastleggt, warrt de bruukt."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:132
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3192
msgid "Default encoding"
msgstr "Standardkoderen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:133
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3195
msgid ""
"The encoding used for files on opening, saving or creation, unless the user "
"overrides it in the project settings or the file dialogs."
msgstr ""
"De Koderen, de bi't Opmaken, Sekern un Opstellen vun Dateien bruukt warrt, "
"wenn de Bruker nix anners binnen de Projektinstellen oder binnen den "
"Dateidialoog fastleggt hett."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:138
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3198
msgid "Tag case"
msgstr "Beteker-Schriefwies"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:139
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3201
msgid ""
"The case used for tag names. 0 is default, 1 is lowercase, 2 is uppercase."
msgstr ""
"De Groot- un Lüttschrieven för Betekers. 0 is Standard, 1 is Lütt- un 2 is "
"Grootschrieven."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:144
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3204
msgid "Attribute case"
msgstr "Attribut-Schriefwies"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:145
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3207
msgid ""
"The case used for tag attribute names. 0 is default, 1 is lowercase, 2 is "
"uppercase."
msgstr ""
"De Groot- un Lüttschrieven för Attributen. 0 is Standard, 1 is Lütt- un 2 is "
"Grootschrieven."

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:150
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3210
msgid "Attribute quotation"
msgstr "Goosfööt bi Attributen"

#. i18n: file: UNPORTED/lib/quanta.kcfg:151
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (Environment)
#: rc.cpp:3213
msgid ""
"The quotation character for attribute values. Can be double (\") or single "
"(') quotes."
msgstr ""
"Dat Goosfoot-Teken för Attribut-Weerten. Kann en dubbelt (»\"«) oder en enkel "
"(»'«) Goosfoot wesen."

